title: "Programme Riemann : corpus de recherche sur l'hypothèse de Riemann (version 6.59)"
version: "6.59"
date-released: 2026-10-17
authors:
  - family-names: "Noël"
    given-names: "Vincent P. P."
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Riemann hypothesis
  - Riemann zeta function
  - mean square
  - simple zeros
  - Weil positivity
abstract: >-
  Versioned research corpus (documents, proofs, code, data, tests) on a mean square built from
  Λ∗Λ − Λ·log + 2γΛ whose growth reflects the position of the zeros of ζ. No proof of the
  Riemann Hypothesis is claimed. Code is MIT-licensed; texts, figures and data are CC BY 4.0.
